 \u00e1rboles, Trocha Shihuahuaco, escalada en Clibing a una plataforma lupuna, y en la misma Hacienda Herrera.\nAdem\u00e1s 4 videos con contenido exclusivo de c\u00e1maras trampa en la selva de madre de Dios.", "short_description": "Primer aplicativo con recorridos 360\u00b0 de la selva en Puerto Maldonado"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "logo-512.png", "id": "2055343438150768", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57572927_2055343441484101_8652722561279519607_n.png?_nc_cat=100&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=VYq5F6QHkpMQ7kNvwGdlpCG&_nc_oc=Adpb13NRypMhWKXe4759TpKlGmevu-cieu80ih0wPZchjtO2NwHsiqxNx-E1zYalsRM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQURk0X-tyr5lyiozUcM5mGI0Fv5iZOX8CuuXOyUe4v9rQ&oe=6B1053D4"}, {"file_name": "1440 HH.png", "id": "1725009814685831", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57570294_1725009818019164_2794798217413603034_n.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=fJUobSdovwcQ7kNvwGthSL8&_nc_oc=AdrUuUZ992ARivo57OgtePWsrz41qEZvIjI3KqAuvRDbhhfWaxEztN-XryCzLUOsHcI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQWUlQUncqqgpGe8KNqvv_DBO79Z2NLPvnAdzpoWEOAfYA&oe=6B104A1D"}, {"file_name": "7x10HH.png", "id": "1264346464967416", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031597_1264346468300749_4624995628890807215_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3DOeByj2FTAQ7kNvwG0gT2C&_nc_oc=AdouyAtt2htv3QrapZhM1wH1wpIHyjU_TISO9oOUt3EDb483k-ZU3qtXRXBVRRaOIZc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQXeyfvzOXOK0rYPnPlxQsJMjEmqmB4my7aQ-xk0J3SbRA&oe=6B103E34"}, {"file_name": "Mesa de trabajo 3hherrera.png", "id": "705420821469944", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-2